            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A fish counting device (50) is provided. It comprises an ultrasonic transducer (53) configured to: transmit a transmission wave towards fish, receive a reflection wave, and generate a reception signal from the reflection wave; a beamforming module (106) that generates echo data in a plurality of directions; a fish tracking module (101b) that tracks detected fish based on the echo data acquired from a plurality of transmissions; and a fish counting module (101a) that counts fish based on the echo data and a number of transmissions from the plurality of transmissions for which the detected fish has been tracked The fish counting module is configured to count fish if a fish has been tracked for at least a given number of transmissions that is set according to a distance (La, Lb) between the transducer and the fish, and a width of the transmission wave (Wa, Wb) at said distance.</p>
            </abstract>
